# Blightmire (CIPlay blightmire): the hummock round 0 -49.6, the roots west -46.5 0, north 12.4 34.1, east 52.7 -9.3
# (burnt in that order: the east one first is refused), the marsh station 18.6 40.3, the root cache by the east root.
island Blightmire
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 -8.8; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 8.8
expect step 0
expect title The Poisoned Marsh
zone hummock
expect step 1
read Blight map
expect step 2
open Smelter camp chest
wait 3
expect step 3
kill Hyena
expect animals Hyena 0
expect step 4
use root3
expect story burnt 0
use suitlocker
expect shown fume1
use root1
expect story burnt 1
expect hidden root1
expect shown fire1
expect hidden fume1
expect step 5
use root2
expect story burnt 2
expect step 6
expect hidden marshstation
use stationvines
expect shown marshstation
open Marsh station locker
wait 3
expect step 7
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
expect step 8
use root3
expect story burnt 3
expect shown rootcache
expect step 9
open Root cache
wait 3
expect step 10
read Seedkeeper's confession
expect done
